      <h1 id="cluster-api-config-options-bare-metal" class="group scroll-mt-20">Cluster API configuration options for bare metal<a href="#cluster-api-config-options-bare-metal" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
